      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "The null Corner",
          "items": [
            "`typeof null === 'object'` — historic bug",
            "`toString.call(null)` gives [object Null]",
            "null has no prototype; `null.x` throws"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Forgetting `super()` in a derived constructor",
            "Or using `this` before it: ReferenceError, not undefined"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Last Traps"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`instanceof` fails across realms — iframes, workers",
            "Different `Array.prototype`; use `Array.isArray`",
            "Extracted class method called bare throws TypeError",
            "`Dog.prototype.toys = []` is shared by every instance",
            "`for...in` sees inherited props — guard `Object.hasOwn`"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Three One-Line Rules",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`prototype` belongs to functions: what instances inherit",
            "`__proto__`/`[[Prototype]]`: what an object inherits from",
            "Reads walk the chain; writes create own properties",
            "Unless a setter or a non-writable prop intervenes"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`function`: `this` comes from the call site",
            "Arrow: `this` comes from the enclosing lexical scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Precedence Recap"
